@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@openOrderId = 1

### 志愿者登录（审批成为志愿者后需要重新登录）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "volunteer_user_001",
  "password": "Ocean1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set(
        "volunteerAccessToken",
        response.body.data.accessToken
    );
%}

### 查看当前可接取的公开工单，不需要 Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rescue-orders/public?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 志愿者查询自己接取的工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteer/rescue-orders/me?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerAccessToken}}

### 志愿者接单（将 openOrderId 修改为真实的 OPEN 工单 ID）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteer/rescue-orders/{{openOrderId}}/accept
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerAccessToken}}

### 重复接取同一工单，应返回业务错误 40909
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteer/rescue-orders/{{openOrderId}}/accept
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerAccessToken}}

### 志愿者提交完成反馈（必须是本人已经接取的工单）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteer/rescue-orders/{{openOrderId}}/completion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerAccessToken}}

{
  "completionDescription": "已经完成环境清理和现场检查",
  "imageUrls": [
    "https://example.com/completion-1.jpg",
    "https://example.com/completion-2.jpg"
  ]
}
